Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-143: laptop package 107's designer part merged
 into the machine tree -- ES02's 0.139-0.143 (0.143.0)

GitHub main 5378c8c (GitLab c723bfdb) is a mixed package: its C++ / web part was applied by the machine-
integration session (9eabe4f, cpp 0063); its 10 files under tools/vscode-htdesigner are merged here. Three-way,
base = the package's _machine_ai/base_dac2adfc (= package 106), CRLF to LF first:
- 7 changed only by ES02, taken as delivered: extension.js, package.json, README.md, WPF_DIFF_LOG.md,
  test/fake_vscode.js, test/smoke_extension.js, and the new lib/cppsymbols.js;
- 3 changed on both sides, git merge-file with no conflict: CHANGELOG.md, HANDOVER.md, test/run_tests.js -- the
  result is ES02's 0.143 plus the machine's tools 0136 / 0137 (the Alias patch's note and test, HANDOVER section 5);
- lib/aliasedit.js (the machine's tools 0136 Alias patch) is not in the package: the machine's copy stays.
ES02's 0.139-0.143: the Pages / Search Pages lists folded into the Solution Explorer; a page opens as design above /
its source below (WPF); C++ tabs close the HTML tabs; class / member navigation over C++ files; the run bar in
the status bar (its play button is F5 -- on the machine the shipping configuration really starts the machine
software); icons for each side view and folders.
HANDOVER.md section 5: mixed packages -- the integration session does the C++ part first; test and commit the
designer part only after it is written and committed (the first smoke run met tools/wb_serve.cpp mid-write: 8
event-wiring checks could not find the form.event dispatch; after its commit 210/210).
Tests on the machine: lib 176/176, probe 7/7 + tab-sheet tree 7/7, extension 210/210, panels all pass.
e2e_build.ps1 not run (it starts wb_serve).

